# Email delivery for the rental + consultation forms (via Resend).
# These are SERVER-side secrets — do NOT prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC.
#
# 1. Create a free account at https://resend.com
# 2. Add your studio domain under Domains and verify it (add the DNS records
#    Resend gives you). This lets you send from your own address.
# 3. Create an API key (Settings → API Keys) and put it in RESEND_API_KEY.
# 4. Set RESEND_FROM to a verified address on that domain.
# 5. LEAD_TO is where submissions are delivered (the studio inbox).
# Set all three locally in .env.local and in your Vercel project settings.
RESEND_API_KEY=
RESEND_FROM="Clay Studio Creations <hello@yourdomain.com>"
LEAD_TO=claycreationshq@gmail.com
